Pin tx esta tocado, hay que soldar directamente al esp. Pin de la derecha del todo de la fila de arriba

## Recovery provisioning

The setup server accepts `POST /deviceSetup` with JSON. It does not accept a
GET request with a body. Connect to the existing device AP (`iot_XXXX`,
password `12345678`) and use the fixed recovery helper from the repository
root:

```bash
python3 tools/provision_device.py
```

The helper has the target location and Wi-Fi credentials built in. It only
prompts for the fresh MQTT token from the latest app registration attempt,
without echoing it, and sends a compact payload compatible with the old
firmware.
